{"id":"4ec60741c4296112","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-tuple-satisfaction.md","title":"Satisfaction by a Finite Tuple","display":"df-tuple-satisfaction — Satisfaction by a Finite Tuple","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","aliases":["17-df-tuple-satisfaction"],"display":"df-tuple-satisfaction — Satisfaction by a Finite Tuple","label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"1.3","source_pages_print":[29],"source_pages_djvu":[45],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local formulation","source_result":"1.3.17","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-free-variable]]","[[17-df-assignment]]","[[17-df-satisfaction]]","[[17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-tuple-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tuple-satisfaction — Satisfaction by a Finite Tuple"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>45</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local formulation"},{"key":"source_result","html":"1.3.17"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee38febe67086306\" href=\"?note=ee38febe67086306\" title=\"17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence\">17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\">\\(\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>。赋值集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\)</span> 和满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=v_i\">\\(x_i=v_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>。以下只为满足所列自由变量条件的输入定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall i&lt;n\\;s(v_i)=\\bar a(i))\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall i&lt;n\\;s(v_i)=\\bar a(i))\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 1.3.17，印刷 p.29。载体非空保证有限元组可扩张成总赋值；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ee38febe67086306\" href=\"?note=ee38febe67086306\" title=\"17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence\">17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence</a> 保证存在赋值与每个扩张赋值等价。允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>，此时还原句子的真值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headi