f-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限元组满足记号采用 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]；合并参数元组时按显示顺序作有限序列拼接。"},{"id":"f21d04ffa9b76787","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。$p$ 为候选函数图；$D=\\operatorname{dom}(p)$。原子公式和自由变量见 [[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-free-variable]]；$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 及有限元组满足关系见 [[17-df-type]]、[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。$\\bar a:n\\to D$，$p\\circ\\bar a$ 为复合元组。$\\operatorname{PartIso}$ 只在固定语言 $L$ 下省略下标。空部分映射允许作候选，但仍须保持无自由变量的原子句。定义不要求 $D$ 对函数符号封闭。"},{"id":"086b1b3d5b60a929","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ is from [[17-df-type]], and tuple satisfaction is from [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]."},{"id":"e1c067a42f0c312e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$n\\in\\omega$；$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。$\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n$。有限元组满足记号取 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。以下定义的三个谓词只在这些输入上使用，$L$ 和显示元数 $n$ 均保留在签名中。"},{"id":"10fd1dfc88760f5b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限元组满足记号取 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]，每个使用处的显示变量须覆盖公式的自由变量。"},{"id":"d88aa28a0fcc379a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限元组满足记号采用 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]；合并参数元组时按显示顺序作有限序列拼接。"},{"id":"a56231382327ecde","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限元组满足记号采用 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]；合并参数元组时按显示顺序作有限序列拼接。"},{"id":"ca75e0773ad7e836","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限元组满足记号采用 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]；合并参数元组时按显示顺序作有限序列拼接。"},{"id":"b992991a5a3d22fd","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限元组满足记号取 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]，每个使用处的显示变量须覆盖公式的自由变量。"},{"id":"99ff69edbf76f2a7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 [[17-thm-los]] 所列 ZFC 元理论中，$I$ 非空，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 是 $I$ 上的超滤子。$P$ 及 $[f]_U$ 取其超积构造的乘积与商类；商结构记号见 [[17-df-ultraproduct-notation]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 与元组满足分别见 [[17-df-type]]、[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"b51a9d2d7c819846","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作，见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\mathfrak B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)$；其乘积载体 $P$ 和商类 $[f]_U$ 见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 为自由变量包含于 $\\{v_j:j<n\\}$ 的公式集，见 [[17-df-type]]；元组满足记号见 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。$\\bar f\\in P^n$ 为代表元的有限元组。"},{"id":"378c046219546f74","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限元组满足记号取 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]，每个使用处的显示变量须覆盖公式的自由变量。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-